 "applies_to": "Bosch commercial water-to-air heat pumps fitted with the Control Air 5600 DDC controller running the water-to-air standard software (integration points list version 1.03).",
 "summary": "The Bosch Control Air 5600 is a BACnet-native DDC controller for water-to-air heat pumps whose EIA-485 port can also run Modbus RTU or N2. The integration points list gives each point a BACnet object and a Modbus register. This map holds the binary commands, alarm and status bits and the mode registers; the floating-point temperatures and setpoints are left out.",
 "transport": [
  "RTU"
 ],
